1.1.0 (Major UX & Intelligence Update)
- Added Auto-Failover: Automatically switches to backup stream URLs if the primary link fails.
- Integrated Keyboard Shortcuts: Space (Play/Pause), F (Fullscreen), M (Mute), Arrows (Volume/Seek).
